# Project context

Stack: DuckDB + dbt (dbt-duckdb), managed with uv and Python 3.12.

## Layout and flow

- Landing: yearly `data/landing/itbi/*.xlsx` (one sheet per month); not queried by models
- Ingest: `uv run python scripts/ingest_raw.py` → DuckDB schema `raw` (full replace per file)
- Transform: `stg_` (views) → `int_` (views) → `dim_` (tables) / `fct_` (incremental merge)
- Materialization details: `docs/modeling.md`
- Always set `DBT_PROFILES_DIR=.` (see `.env.example`)

Never read landing XLSX from dbt models; go through `source('raw', ...)` after ingest.

## Day-to-day

```bash
uv sync
source .venv/bin/activate
export DBT_PROFILES_DIR=.
dbt debug
```

Use Ruff for Python (`uv run ruff format .` / `uv run ruff check --fix .`). Track progress in `ITERATION_LOG.md`.
